1
00:00:01,925 --> 00:00:03,718
KATARA: Water.

2
00:00:04,344 --> 00:00:05,970
Earth.

3
00:00:06,262 --> 00:00:07,972
Fire.

4
00:00:08,306 --> 00:00:09,599
Air.

5
00:00:10,642 --> 00:00:14,103
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:14,687 --> 00:00:18,191
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,067 --> 00:00:23,112
Only the Avatar, master of all
four elements, could stop them.

8
00:00:23,196 --> 00:00:25,198
But when the world needed him most,

9
00:00:25,281 --> 00:00:26,574
he vanished.

10
00:00:26,950 --> 00:00:30,662
100 years passed and my brother and I
discovered the new Avatar.

11
00:00:30,912 --> 00:00:32,413
An airbender named Aang.

12
00:00:32,622 --> 00:00:34,832
And although his airbending
skills are great,

13
00:00:34,916 --> 00:00:37,335
he has a lot to learn before
he's ready to save anyone.

14
00:00:37,418 --> 00:00:38,461
AANG: Oof.

15
00:00:38,795 --> 00:00:41,506
But I believe Aang can save the world.

16
00:00:41,756 --> 00:00:43,383
[ ♪... ]

17
00:00:47,595 --> 00:00:49,806
( MAN READING )

18
00:00:50,014 --> 00:00:51,724
I'm losing this war.

19
00:00:51,933 --> 00:00:53,977
I'm letting the whole world down.

20
00:00:54,143 --> 00:00:57,480
I should have seen this war coming,
and prevented it.

21
00:00:57,897 --> 00:01:01,276
For so long, I thought that
if my dad accepted me, I'd be happy.

22
00:01:01,484 --> 00:01:03,486
I'm back home now. My dad talks to me.

23
00:01:03,570 --> 00:01:05,029
Everything should be perfect, right?

24
00:01:05,113 --> 00:01:07,240
I should be happy now, but I'm not.

25
00:01:07,699 --> 00:01:10,660
Please, uncle, I'm so confused.
I need your help.

26
00:01:11,953 --> 00:01:14,247
Forget it. I'll solve this myself.

27
00:01:14,372 --> 00:01:16,040
Waste away in here for all I care.

28
00:01:24,132 --> 00:01:28,678
Aang, it's time you learned
my history with Fire Lord Sozin.

29
00:01:29,053 --> 00:01:34,559
You need to understand how the war began
if you want to know how to end it.

30
00:01:35,643 --> 00:01:39,981
Meet my on my home island
on the day of the summer solstice.

31
00:01:42,609 --> 00:01:43,985
Okay, Roku.

32
00:01:45,111 --> 00:01:48,114
( FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING )

33
00:01:57,540 --> 00:02:00,627
"You need to know the story
of your great-grandfather's demise.

34
00:02:01,044 --> 00:02:03,046
"It will reveal your own destiny."

35
00:02:14,265 --> 00:02:16,434
( GROWLING )

36
00:02:16,517 --> 00:02:17,560
AANG: There it is.

37
00:02:17,810 --> 00:02:19,729
That's Roku's home.

38
00:02:21,898 --> 00:02:24,400
KATARA: But, there's nothing here.

39
00:02:25,943 --> 00:02:27,570
Yes, there is.

40
00:02:27,820 --> 00:02:29,238
An entire village.

41
00:02:29,405 --> 00:02:31,115
Hundreds of houses.

42
00:02:31,324 --> 00:02:33,618
All completely buried in ash.

43
00:02:38,498 --> 00:02:41,542
AZULA: It's never too early for
a sitting with the court painter, Zuko.

44
00:02:41,876 --> 00:02:44,128
Make sure he gets your good side.

45
00:02:45,129 --> 00:02:46,339
Wait.

46
00:02:46,673 --> 00:02:47,882
I need to ask you something.

47
00:02:48,257 --> 00:02:50,301
What do you remember about
our great-grandfather's history?

48
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:51,844
Ah, Zuko.

49
00:02:51,928 --> 00:02:53,805
It's so strange how your mind works.

50
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:56,849
Fire Lord Sozin began the war, of course.

51
00:02:56,974 --> 00:02:59,769
He spent his early years
secretly preparing for it

52
00:02:59,936 --> 00:03:01,938
But he was as patient as he was clever.

53
00:03:02,188 --> 00:03:05,817
He famously waited for the comet,
later renamed Sozin's comet

54
00:03:06,067 --> 00:03:09,487
and used its power to launch
his full-scale invasion of the world.

55
00:03:09,904 --> 00:03:13,199
In the end, he died
a very old and successful man.

56
00:03:13,366 --> 00:03:14,909
But how did he die?

57
00:03:14,992 --> 00:03:17,578
Didn't you pay any attention in school,
Zuko?

58
00:03:17,912 --> 00:03:19,789
He died peacefully, in his sleep.

59
00:03:19,872 --> 00:03:20,873
He was ancient.

60
00:03:50,611 --> 00:03:52,447
What does it mean?

61
00:03:55,700 --> 00:03:56,868
( GASPS )

62
00:03:59,662 --> 00:04:04,292
"The Fire Sages keep the secret history
in the Dragonbone Catacombs."

63
00:05:00,973 --> 00:05:03,267
"The Final Testament of Fire Lord Sozin."

64
00:05:04,185 --> 00:05:05,853
ROKU: Come, Aang.

65
00:05:06,771 --> 00:05:08,064
AANG: Where are we going?

66
00:05:08,356 --> 00:05:10,107
To visit my past.

67
00:05:10,608 --> 00:05:12,610
Our shared past.

68
00:05:14,445 --> 00:05:18,783
SOZIN: As I feel my own life dimming,
I can't help but think

69
00:05:18,866 --> 00:05:22,245
of a time when everything
was so much brighter.

70
00:05:24,038 --> 00:05:25,873
I remember my friend.

71
00:05:35,424 --> 00:05:37,301
( STAMMERING )

72
00:05:38,678 --> 00:05:40,179
( GRUNTS )

73
00:05:41,055 --> 00:05:42,849
Looks like I win again, Roku.

74
00:05:43,224 --> 00:05:44,392
Are you kidding?

75
00:05:44,475 --> 00:05:46,310
The tree root did all the work.

76
00:05:47,979 --> 00:05:49,856
Nice one, Sozin.

77
00:05:49,939 --> 00:05:52,275
You were friends with Fire Lord Sozin?

78
00:05:52,775 --> 00:05:57,613
Back then he was just Prince Sozin,
and he was my best friend.

79
00:06:00,449 --> 00:06:01,868
( SIGHING )

80
00:06:02,285 --> 00:06:03,369
Say something to her.

81
00:06:04,287 --> 00:06:08,207
Uh... ( GROANS )

82
00:06:11,085 --> 00:06:13,754
Love is hard when you're young.

83
00:06:14,130 --> 00:06:15,590
You don't have to tell me.

84
00:06:15,798 --> 00:06:16,883
Don't worry.

85
00:06:17,049 --> 00:06:18,342
It gets better.

86
00:06:18,551 --> 00:06:20,052
Now come with me.

87
00:06:20,469 --> 00:06:22,555
We have a party to attend.

88
00:06:23,431 --> 00:06:25,182
AANG: Wait, whose party is it?

89
00:06:26,058 --> 00:06:30,438
ROKU: Sozin and I shared many things,
including a birthday.

90
00:06:30,730 --> 00:06:33,316
( CHEERING AND APPLAUSE )

91
00:06:33,441 --> 00:06:34,442
( GIGGLING )

92
00:06:35,234 --> 00:06:36,777
( GASPING )

93
00:06:38,237 --> 00:06:39,697
( LAUGHING )

94
00:06:42,158 --> 00:06:43,868
SOZIN: Did something happen to my father?

95
00:06:43,951 --> 00:06:45,119
No, Prince Sozin.

96
00:06:45,453 --> 00:06:46,913
We are not here for you.

97
00:06:47,330 --> 00:06:50,207
We are here to announce
the identity of the next Avatar.

98
00:06:50,499 --> 00:06:52,168
( PEOPLE WHISPERING )

99
00:06:52,376 --> 00:06:57,423
It is our honor to serve you, Avatar Roku.

100
00:07:09,060 --> 00:07:11,646
SOZIN: Soon, the day came
when my friend Roku

101
00:07:11,729 --> 00:07:15,816
had to leave the Fire Nation
and face his destiny as the Avatar.

102
00:07:16,609 --> 00:07:21,739
He needed to travel the world
so he could master the other elements.

103
00:07:22,323 --> 00:07:25,576
Hey, why aren't you packed yet,
all-powerful Avatar?

104
00:07:27,995 --> 00:07:32,083
Come on, show me how it's done
using all four kinds of bending.

105
00:07:35,169 --> 00:07:38,089
I started packing,
but then the Fire Sages told me

106
00:07:38,172 --> 00:07:40,508
I won't need any
worldly possessions anymore.

107
00:07:40,967 --> 00:07:41,968
Oh.

108
00:07:43,010 --> 00:07:44,595
It happened so fast.

109
00:07:44,679 --> 00:07:46,263
Everything's gonna be different now.

110
00:07:50,017 --> 00:07:51,018
Here.

111
00:07:51,102 --> 00:07:52,895
I hope you're at least
allowed to have this.

112
00:07:53,562 --> 00:07:55,272
ROKU: But this is a royal artifact.

113
00:07:56,107 --> 00:07:58,109
It's supposed to be worn
by the crown prince.

114
00:07:58,401 --> 00:07:59,610
I want you to have it.

115
00:08:19,505 --> 00:08:22,174
( GROANING )

116
00:08:22,550 --> 00:08:24,969
Do they have bathrooms
in the Spirit World?

117
00:08:25,302 --> 00:08:27,388
As a matter of fact, they do not.

118
00:08:30,766 --> 00:08:33,060
Hey, we're almost at
the Southern Air Temple.

119
00:08:33,269 --> 00:08:36,647
This was the first stop
on my Avatar journey.

120
00:08:37,106 --> 00:08:40,776
It was the place where I was
trained to master airbending,

121
00:08:40,860 --> 00:08:45,823
and also where I met
an old friend of yours, monk Gyatso.

122
00:08:46,240 --> 00:08:47,283
AANG: No way!

123
00:08:52,580 --> 00:08:54,749
Hey, Gyatso,
you want to see a new glider trick?

124
00:08:59,378 --> 00:09:01,088
( LAUGHING ) Check this out.

125
00:09:03,007 --> 00:09:04,008
AANG: He's air-surfing.

126
00:09:04,467 --> 00:09:06,302
I can't believe I never thought of that.

127
00:09:07,511 --> 00:09:08,846
( SCREAMING )

128
00:09:12,099 --> 00:09:13,559
( GASPING )

129
00:09:13,642 --> 00:09:15,352
( SCREAMING )

130
00:09:15,436 --> 00:09:16,520
( CRASHING )

131
00:09:18,314 --> 00:09:20,316
AANG: That's amazing.

132
00:09:20,399 --> 00:09:23,152
I can't believe you were friends
with monk Gyatso just like I was.

133
00:09:23,694 --> 00:09:30,076
Some friendships are so strong,
they can even transcend lifetimes.

134
00:09:33,537 --> 00:09:39,418
After my years mastering airbending,
I traveled to the Northern Water Tribe.

135
00:09:39,919 --> 00:09:43,506
Waterbending was
especially challenging for me.

136
00:09:47,176 --> 00:09:49,970
But in time, I mastered it as well.

137
00:09:51,847 --> 00:09:53,766
( YELLING )

138
00:10:04,735 --> 00:10:06,904
I moved on to the Earth Kingdom.

139
00:10:10,616 --> 00:10:16,330
My earthbending master, Sud,
was uncompromising, stubborn, and blunt.

140
00:10:18,916 --> 00:10:21,460
And a lifelong friend.

141
00:10:22,378 --> 00:10:23,963
( LAUGHING )

142
00:10:24,463 --> 00:10:25,631
( GASPING )

143
00:10:35,266 --> 00:10:40,813
ROKU: It was bitter work,
but the results were worth it.

144
00:10:48,821 --> 00:10:52,700
SOZIN: Twelve long years passed
before I saw my friend again.

145
00:10:53,576 --> 00:10:58,038
When Roku returned,
he was a fully realized Avatar,

146
00:10:58,539 --> 00:11:00,374
and I had changed as well.

147
00:11:00,791 --> 00:11:04,295
Sozin, or should I say, Fire Lord.

148
00:11:04,461 --> 00:11:08,007
Customarily, my subjects bow
before greeting me,

149
00:11:09,508 --> 00:11:11,343
but you're the exception.

150
00:11:13,721 --> 00:11:17,641
ROKU: After all these years,
he was still my best friend.

151
00:11:18,225 --> 00:11:22,104
And a few months later,
he was my best man.

152
00:11:26,192 --> 00:11:29,195
AANG: Roku, it's that girl
who didn't even know you were alive.

153
00:11:29,320 --> 00:11:30,487
ROKU: Ta Min.

154
00:11:30,905 --> 00:11:32,740
I was persistent.

155
00:11:32,865 --> 00:11:36,577
When love is real, it finds a way.

156
00:11:37,411 --> 00:11:41,665
And being the Avatar doesn't hurt
your chances with the ladies, either.

157
00:11:42,082 --> 00:11:45,878
SOZIN: On wedding days, we look
to the future with optimism and joy.

158
00:11:46,712 --> 00:11:49,965
I had my own vision for a brighter future.

159
00:11:51,926 --> 00:11:53,010
Excuse me.

160
00:11:53,761 --> 00:11:55,512
May I borrow him for a moment?

161
00:11:55,804 --> 00:11:57,973
It's not very traditional, but okay.

162
00:12:00,851 --> 00:12:02,186
What's on your mind?

163
00:12:02,895 --> 00:12:05,689
I've been thinking hard about
the state of the world lately.

164
00:12:05,773 --> 00:12:07,274
Sozin, it's my wedding.

165
00:12:07,358 --> 00:12:08,359
Have a cookie.

166
00:12:08,442 --> 00:12:10,361
Dance with someone. Lighten up.

167
00:12:10,569 --> 00:12:12,821
I know, I know, but just hear me out.

168
00:12:15,366 --> 00:12:18,369
Right from the start,
I was destined to be Fire Lord,

169
00:12:19,161 --> 00:12:22,873
and although we didn't always know it,
you were destined to be the Avatar.

170
00:12:23,374 --> 00:12:26,752
It's an amazing stroke of fate
we know each other so well, isn't it?

171
00:12:27,586 --> 00:12:30,172
Together, we could do anything.

172
00:12:30,547 --> 00:12:32,758
Yeah, we could.

173
00:12:33,217 --> 00:12:37,388
SOZIN: Our nation is enjoying
an unprecedented time of peace and wealth.

174
00:12:37,471 --> 00:12:42,017
Our people are happy,
and we're so fortunate in so many ways.

175
00:12:42,434 --> 00:12:43,978
Where are you going with this?

176
00:12:44,853 --> 00:12:46,272
I've been thinking.

177
00:12:46,355 --> 00:12:49,400
We should share this prosperity
with the rest of the world.

178
00:12:49,900 --> 00:12:53,112
In our hands
is the most successful empire in history.

179
00:12:53,529 --> 00:12:55,197
It's time we expanded it.

180
00:12:55,614 --> 00:12:59,451
No. The four nations are meant
to be just that: four.

181
00:12:59,660 --> 00:13:02,788
Roku, you haven't even stopped
to consider the possibilities.

182
00:13:02,997 --> 00:13:04,957
There are no possibilities.

183
00:13:05,207 --> 00:13:06,917
This is the last
I want to hear about this.

184
00:13:09,128 --> 00:13:12,756
ROKU: That was my first
real test as the Avatar.

185
00:13:13,007 --> 00:13:16,635
Unfortunately, it was many years
before I learned that Sozin

186
00:13:16,719 --> 00:13:20,597
had gone ahead with his plan,
despite my warning.

187
00:13:35,321 --> 00:13:37,281
I've seen the colony, Sozin.

188
00:13:37,364 --> 00:13:40,242
How dare you occupy
Earth Kingdom territory?

189
00:13:40,826 --> 00:13:44,079
How dare you,
a citizen of the Fire Nation,

190
00:13:44,204 --> 00:13:46,540
address your Fire Lord this way?

191
00:13:47,374 --> 00:13:50,336
Your loyalty is to our nation first.

192
00:13:50,419 --> 00:13:52,629
Anything less makes you a traitor.

193
00:13:53,047 --> 00:13:54,506
Don't do this, Sozin.

194
00:13:54,715 --> 00:13:56,425
Don't challenge me.

195
00:13:56,508 --> 00:13:58,260
It will only end badly.

196
00:13:59,928 --> 00:14:01,180
It's over.

197
00:14:05,809 --> 00:14:06,894
( YELLING )

198
00:14:13,942 --> 00:14:17,446
( SCREAMING )

199
00:14:34,046 --> 00:14:36,131
I'm sparing you, Sozin.

200
00:14:36,465 --> 00:14:40,219
I'm letting you go
in the name of our past friendship.

201
00:14:40,302 --> 00:14:43,764
But I warn you,
even a single step out of line

202
00:14:43,847 --> 00:14:47,017
will result in your permanent end.

203
00:15:00,280 --> 00:15:02,616
ROKU: Sozin and I didn't speak
or see each other

204
00:15:02,699 --> 00:15:05,619
for 25 years after our battle.

205
00:15:06,203 --> 00:15:10,749
I spent most of my spare time here,
at my home.

206
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,336
( WHOOSHING )

207
00:15:23,929 --> 00:15:26,640
( COUGHING )

208
00:15:29,935 --> 00:15:31,687
ROKU: Let's go.

209
00:16:05,387 --> 00:16:07,973
SOZIN: Roku's island was 100 miles away.

210
00:16:08,515 --> 00:16:11,143
But I could still feel it rumbling,

211
00:16:11,518 --> 00:16:13,770
and see the black plume of smoke.

212
00:16:14,229 --> 00:16:17,608
I had never seen anything
like this catastrophe.

213
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:11,578
AANG: This is amazing, Roku.

214
00:17:11,954 --> 00:17:14,831
You're battling a volcano,
and you're winning.

215
00:17:14,915 --> 00:17:18,710
Unfortunately,
my success didn't last, Aang.

216
00:17:18,919 --> 00:17:21,797
There was no way I could do it all.

217
00:17:45,028 --> 00:17:47,155
ROKU: Battling the elements
was hard enough,

218
00:17:47,406 --> 00:17:50,117
I had to do it
while I could barely breathe.

219
00:17:50,450 --> 00:17:54,830
The poisonous, volcanic gasses
were overwhelming.

220
00:17:55,038 --> 00:17:57,124
( THUNDER CRASHING )

221
00:17:57,791 --> 00:17:59,251
( SCREECHES )

222
00:17:59,334 --> 00:18:02,004
It's all right, Fang. ( COUGHS )

223
00:18:02,212 --> 00:18:05,257
Get out of here, I'm fine.

224
00:18:28,071 --> 00:18:29,323
SOZIN: Need a hand, old friend?

225
00:18:30,032 --> 00:18:31,491
Sozin?

226
00:18:32,284 --> 00:18:33,744
There's not a moment to waste.

227
00:18:56,558 --> 00:18:57,809
( THUNDER CRASHES )

228
00:18:59,394 --> 00:19:00,562
( GASPS )

229
00:19:08,820 --> 00:19:11,073
ROKU: Don't breathe the toxic gas.

230
00:19:18,038 --> 00:19:21,708
( COUGHING )

231
00:19:21,792 --> 00:19:24,670
It's... Too much.

232
00:19:25,337 --> 00:19:28,382
( GASPS AND COUGHS )

233
00:19:28,465 --> 00:19:30,050
Please...

234
00:19:32,094 --> 00:19:35,597
Without you,
all my plans are suddenly possible.

235
00:19:35,847 --> 00:19:38,558
I have a vision for the future, Roku.

236
00:19:44,398 --> 00:19:45,440
( COUGHING )

237
00:19:58,453 --> 00:20:01,665
( SCREECHES )

238
00:20:09,089 --> 00:20:12,884
( BABY CRYING )

239
00:20:12,968 --> 00:20:16,680
AANG: Who's... Wait, that's me, isn't it?

240
00:20:16,972 --> 00:20:19,015
ROKU: Make sense of our past, Aang.

241
00:20:19,766 --> 00:20:24,312
And you will bring peace
and restore balance in the world.

242
00:20:24,479 --> 00:20:25,605
Roku?

243
00:20:26,022 --> 00:20:28,150
Roku...

244
00:20:29,359 --> 00:20:32,696
SOZIN: With Roku gone,
and the great comet returning

245
00:20:32,904 --> 00:20:36,032
the timing was perfect
to change the world.

246
00:20:36,658 --> 00:20:40,078
I knew the next Avatar
would be born an air nomad.

247
00:20:40,829 --> 00:20:43,790
So I wiped out the air temples.

248
00:20:43,874 --> 00:20:46,543
But somehow, the new Avatar eluded me.

249
00:20:47,502 --> 00:20:51,840
I wasted the remainder
of my life searching in vain.

250
00:20:52,048 --> 00:20:54,301
I know he's hiding out there somewhere,

251
00:20:54,509 --> 00:20:57,554
the Fire Nation's greatest threat.

252
00:20:57,637 --> 00:21:00,307
The last airbender.

253
00:21:03,852 --> 00:21:07,022
That can't be it, where's the rest of it?

254
00:21:15,864 --> 00:21:17,824
You sent this, didn't you?

255
00:21:18,074 --> 00:21:19,743
I found the secret history.

256
00:21:19,910 --> 00:21:23,330
Which, by the way, should be renamed
"The History Most People Already Know."

257
00:21:23,872 --> 00:21:26,583
The note said that I needed to know
about my great-grandfather's death,

258
00:21:26,875 --> 00:21:28,418
but he was still alive in the end.

259
00:21:28,752 --> 00:21:30,837
No. He wasn't.

260
00:21:31,671 --> 00:21:33,548
What are you talking about?

261
00:21:33,632 --> 00:21:36,927
You have more than one great-grandfather,
Prince Zuko.

262
00:21:37,302 --> 00:21:39,888
Sozin was your father's grandfather.

263
00:21:40,138 --> 00:21:44,643
Your mother's grandfather was Avatar Roku.

264
00:21:45,894 --> 00:21:47,437
Why are you telling me this?

265
00:21:47,646 --> 00:21:52,317
Because understanding the struggle
between your two great-grandfathers

266
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:56,780
can help you better understand
the battle within yourself.

267
00:21:59,115 --> 00:22:02,661
Evil and good are always
at war inside you, Zuko.

268
00:22:02,828 --> 00:22:05,372
It is your nature, your legacy.

269
00:22:05,664 --> 00:22:08,333
But, there is a bright side.

270
00:22:09,709 --> 00:22:13,797
What happened generations ago
can be resolved now.

271
00:22:14,256 --> 00:22:15,632
By you.

272
00:22:15,757 --> 00:22:21,179
Because of your legacy, you alone
can cleanse the sins of our family,

273
00:22:21,263 --> 00:22:23,056
and the Fire Nation.

274
00:22:23,515 --> 00:22:26,476
Born in you, along with all this strife

275
00:22:26,685 --> 00:22:31,314
is the power
to restore balance to the world.

276
00:22:36,069 --> 00:22:39,197
This is a royal artifact.

277
00:22:40,156 --> 00:22:43,660
It's supposed to be worn
by the crown prince.

278
00:22:52,711 --> 00:22:55,922
KATARA: You mean, after all Roku
and Sozin went through together,

279
00:22:56,006 --> 00:22:59,676
even after Roku showed him mercy,
Sozin betrayed him like that?

280
00:23:00,176 --> 00:23:02,762
It's like these people are born bad.

281
00:23:02,846 --> 00:23:04,306
AANG: No, that's wrong.

282
00:23:04,598 --> 00:23:07,100
I don't think that was the point
of what Roku showed me at all.

283
00:23:07,642 --> 00:23:08,935
Then what was the point?

284
00:23:09,269 --> 00:23:12,147
Roku was just as much Fire Nation
as Sozin was, right?

285
00:23:12,522 --> 00:23:16,401
If anything, their story proves anyone's
capable of great good and great evil.

286
00:23:16,943 --> 00:23:19,613
Everyone, even the Fire Lord
and the Fire Nation,

287
00:23:19,696 --> 00:23:21,907
have to be treated like
they're worth giving a chance.

288
00:23:22,490 --> 00:23:24,534
And I also think it was about friendships.

289
00:23:25,702 --> 00:23:29,039
Do you really think friendships
can last more than one lifetime?

290
00:23:30,665 --> 00:23:32,375
I don't see why not.

291
00:23:32,500 --> 00:23:35,629
SOKKA: Well, scientifically speaking,
there's no way to prove that...

292
00:23:35,712 --> 00:23:37,756
Oh, Sokka, just hold hands.

293
00:23:48,683 --> 00:23:50,685
( CLOSING THEME PLAYING )
